    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes are thrilled to present to the market 166 Belgrove Park, a stunning 3 bed townhouse in this highly sought after location. The property has a wonderful sense of space as one walks through the house, and comes to the market in turn-key condition. This fine property is within walking distance of all the amenities Clontarf has to offer and only 10 minutes’ walk from Clontarf Promenade.  \r\n\r\nThis light filled accommodation extends to approx. 117 sq m / 1,259 sq ft and comprises in brief of utility room, living room / dining room and kitchen on the ground floor. While on the first floor there are 2 spacious double bedroom and a bathroom. The top floor boosts a stunning master suite with en suite bathroom and a sunny south east facing balcony.  \r\n\r\nThe location of Belgrove Park, Mount Prosect Lawns is second to none. Clontarf promenade and cycle track, and Clontarf village and its various boutiques and restaurants are within walking distance. Eastpoint Business Park, the IFSC and Clontarf DART station are just a short distance away.  There is a superb choice of both primary and secondary schools in the vicinity. The area is serviced by excellent transport links to the City Centre and beyond, with a quality bus corridor on the Clontarf Road. The M50 and Dublin Airport are also within a short drive."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Utility Room: \r\nWith shelving, washing machine and tumble dryer\r\n\r\nLiving Room / Dining:\r\nBright room overlooking the rear of the property with laminate flooring, understairs storage and modern built-in media unit \r\n\r\nDining area with built-in window seats and patio doors to rear \r\n\r\nKitchen :\r\nModern, renovated kitchen with wall and floor units, integrated appliances, recessed lighting and laminate flooring \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \r\nLarge double bedroom with built-in wardrobe and laminate flooring \r\n\r\nBathroom:\r\nWith WC, wash hand basin and bath with shower attachment\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \r\nDouble bedroom with laminate flooring and built-in wardrobes \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 / Master Bedroom: \r\nLarge master bedroom overlooking the rear with plush carpet flooring, walk-in wardrobe and access to a private sunny balcony. Access to: \r\n\r\nEn Suite: \r\nWith WC, wash hand basin and walk-in shower \r\n\r\nAttic: \r\nAttic space for storage can be access via a hatch\r\n\r\nManagement Company: \r\nPetra Management Company  \r\n\r\nManagement Fees: \r\nApprox 2,600 per annum (subject to change)  \r\n\r\nServices:\r\nGas Fired Central Heating \r\nDouble glazed windows \r\nAlarm panel \r\nDesignated underground parking with personal EV charging point\r\n\r\nBER Details:\r\nBER: C2 \r\nBER No.: 109780502 \r\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 179.86 kWh/m²/yr \r\n\r\nContents - Included: carpets, curtains, curtain poles, blinds, standard fixed light fittings, integrated appliances and all standard fixtures and fittings \r\nNot included – no standard hanging light fittings, non-integrated appliances. EV car charger device"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stunning 3 bed, 3 storey townhouse in a private development \r\nApprox. 117 sq m / 1,259 sq ft \r\nTwo designated underground parking spaces \r\nSouth east facing balcony and own door entrance \r\nConvenient and sought-after location"
      },
      {
